--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Shrike
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 10
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Targeting Array
    AbilityDescription: 'Y: Charge mode. RT (held) paints a target - a rival vessel first, then a creature, then a plant,
      then the centre of the mass nearest your aim - and every nest flora with a ready missile
      launches it, one each per 0.8 s, homing while you paint. A missile blows on contact in an 18 u
      blast (a shield takes the hit first); a rival hull inside it is a petal hit (petals only -
      nothing is moved). The card counts the missiles left across every flora. A collected crystal
      becomes a nest flora that grows large missiles (one per 6 s, up to 4). Space widens the lock
      cone 5 -> 14 degrees at level 10 (ShrikeConfigSO.lockCone).'
    Input: 14
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Nest
    AbilityDescription: 'A. Any block you touch docks you (the camera eases back); docked, every cooldown runs x1.6 (x2.5
      on super-shielded mass or in a nest). Docked, A detaches you and leaves a nest behind: a cup of
      super-shielded blocks round where you were, no two touching, the nose''s way out open, crowned
      with a flora carrying ONE missile (8 s cooldown; at most three nests). Mass is volume - one
      dial: 12 -> 32 blocks per nest at level 10 (ShrikeConfigSO.nestBlocks), and the cruising
      trail''s wavelength 8 -> 4 u (trailWavelength).'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Void Lance
    AbilityDescription: 'X: Space mode. RT (held) fires a hitscan beam 2400 u long that breaks every block it passes, any
      domain, except super-shielded mass and the nest you are docked in; a rival hull on the line is a
      scored petal hit. 1.2 s cooldown, faster docked. Charge widens the beam 1.5 -> 5 u at level 10
      (ShrikeConfigSO.lanceRadius).'
    Input: 8
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Void Pierce
    UpgradeDescription: 'The Void Lance breaks super-shielded mass too.'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Void Sling
    AbilityDescription: 'B: Time mode. RT shoots a tether (1600 u); it anchors on the first block it meets and the hull
      flies straight there in exactly 1 s, laying thick trail, docking on the first block it touches.
      A crystal resets it. Time is rate - one dial: the cooldown 6 -> 2.5 s at level 10
      (ShrikeConfigSO.slingCooldown).'
    Input: 7
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
